// dungeon_layout — long-range belief broadcast (stage 2 wiring).
// AbilityId 4 (alphabetical: after Heal=3, before Snipe=5).
//
// Stage 1: a no-op placeholder. The ability parses cleanly so the
// alphabetical slot ID is stable across stages. damage 0.0 emits an
// EffectDamageApplied chronicle row with amount=0 — the .sim's
// ApplyDamage rule's `new_hp = old_hp - 0.0` is a no-op so this
// ability has no behavioural side-effect today.
//
// Stage 2 will replace the body with a belief-broadcast effect that
// emits SymptomSeen-shape events for every enemy in radius, building
// a Hero-side enemy-positions map.

ability Scout {
    target: enemy
    range: 18.0
    cooldown: 12
    hint: damage

    damage 0.0 [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
